#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/dns/host_record.py:62
#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/dns/forward_zone.py:110
msgid ""
"The FQDNs of the hosts responsible for receiving mail for this DNS name."
msgstr ""
"Die FQDNs der Rechner, die für den E-Mail-Empfang für diesen DNS-Namen "
"zuständig sind."

#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/dns/ns_record.py:53
msgid "The FQDNs of the hosts serving the named zone."
msgstr "Die FQDNs der Rechner, die genannte Zone bereitstellen."

#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/dns/reverse_zone.py:104
#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/dns/forward_zone.py:103
